### DevMatch API
### Use este arquivo com:
### - VS Code: extensao "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### - IntelliJ IDEA: HTTP Client embutido
### - Importavel no Postman e Insomnia
###
### Para Postman/Insomnia (importacao):
### 1. Copie um bloco "###" inteiro.
### 2. Cole como "Raw text" no Postman ou via "Import > Clipboard" no Insomnia.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = rafael@example.com
@password = senha12345

###
# 1) Register - cria um novo candidato e retorna JWT (HTTP 201)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rafael Dev",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# 2) Login - autentica e retorna JWT (HTTP 200)
# Copie o "token" da resposta para usar nas chamadas autenticadas abaixo.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# 3) Register com payload invalido - validacao falha (HTTP 400)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "nao-eh-email",
  "password": "123"
}

###
# 4) Register com email ja cadastrado (HTTP 409)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro Nome",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "outrasenha123"
}

###
# 5) Login com senha errada (HTTP 401)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

###
# 6) Endpoint protegido SEM token - retorna 401 com JSON
GET {{host}}/api/profile/me

###
# 7) Endpoint protegido COM token - autenticacao passa
# Substitua <TOKEN> pelo valor retornado pelo /login acima.
GET {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 8) Health check publico (HTTP 200) - nao requer token
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

###
# 9) Swagger UI - abra no navegador
# http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
# Clique em "Authorize" e cole o token (sem o prefixo "Bearer ").

###
### =========================================================
### Perfil do candidato e catalogo de skills
### Substitua <TOKEN> nos exemplos abaixo pelo token do login.
### =========================================================

###
# 10) GET catalogo de skills (autenticado)
# Use a resposta para escolher quais skills colocar no PUT /api/profile/me.
GET {{host}}/api/skills
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 11) GET meu perfil - logo apos o register, vem com seniority/salary/workMode/summary nulos e skills vazias
GET {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 12) PUT meu perfil - update completo (esperado: 200, perfil atualizado)
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seniority": "JUNIOR",
  "desiredSalary": 4000.00,
  "preferredWorkMode": "REMOTE",
  "professionalSummary": "Desenvolvedor backend Java com foco em Spring Boot e APIs REST.",
  "skillNames": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "SQL", "React"]
}

###
# 13) PUT com validacao falhando (esperado: 400)
# desiredSalary negativo, seniority/workMode/skillNames nulos
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seniority": null,
  "desiredSalary": -100,
  "preferredWorkMode": null,
  "professionalSummary": "ok",
  "skillNames": null
}

###
# 14) PUT com skill desconhecida (esperado: 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seniority": "JUNIOR",
  "desiredSalary": 4000.00,
  "preferredWorkMode": "REMOTE",
  "professionalSummary": "teste",
  "skillNames": ["Java", "COBOL", "Visual Basic"]
}

###
# 15) GET perfil sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{host}}/api/profile/me

###
### =========================================================
### Vagas e filtros
### Substitua <TOKEN> nos exemplos abaixo pelo token do login.
### =========================================================

###
# 16) GET todas as vagas (esperado: 200, 12 itens)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 17) GET vaga pelo id (esperado: 200)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 18) GET vaga inexistente (esperado: 404)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/9999
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 19) Filtro por senioridade (esperado: somente vagas JUNIOR)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?seniority=JUNIOR
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 20) Filtro por modalidade (esperado: somente REMOTE)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?workMode=REMOTE
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 21) Filtro por salario minimo (esperado: vagas com maxSalary >= 10000)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?minSalary=10000
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 22) Filtro por skill (esperado: somente vagas que exigem React)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?skill=React
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 23) Filtro por keyword (busca em titulo/empresa/descricao)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?keyword=fullstack
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 24) Combinacao de filtros: PLENO + REMOTE + Java + salario >= 6000
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?seniority=MID_LEVEL&workMode=REMOTE&skill=Java&minSalary=6000
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 25) Filtro com enum invalido (esperado: 400 - parse error do Spring)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs?seniority=ALIEN
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 26) GET /api/jobs sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs

###
### =========================================================
### Algoritmo de match
### Substitua <TOKEN> pelo token do login.
### Importante: para um score significativo, preencha o perfil via PUT /api/profile/me antes.
### =========================================================

###
# 27) Recomendacao: todas as vagas ordenadas por score desc
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/recommended
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 28) Match detalhado para a vaga 1
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/1/match
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 29) Match para vaga inexistente (esperado: 404)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/9999/match
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###
# 30) Setup completo para reproduzir o exemplo do PDF (score 85)
# 1) Faca um PUT em /api/profile/me com:
#    seniority=JUNIOR, desiredSalary=4000, preferredWorkMode=REMOTE,
#    skillNames=["Java","Spring Boot","SQL","React"]
# 2) Chame GET /api/jobs/1/match (Desenvolvedor Java Junior, JUNIOR/REMOTE/3500-5000,
#    skills exigidas: Java, Spring Boot, SQL, Git)
# Esperado: skills 3/4=75, seniority=100, workMode=100, salary=100, finalScore=85
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seniority": "JUNIOR",
  "desiredSalary": 4000,
  "preferredWorkMode": "REMOTE",
  "professionalSummary": "Junior Java backend.",
  "skillNames": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "SQL", "React"]
}

###
# 31) Apos o PUT acima, este match deve retornar finalScore=85
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/1/match
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
